---
const year = new Date().getFullYear();
---
<footer><div class="container system-line"><span>TM SYSTEM // DOCUMENTATION NODE</span><span><i aria-hidden="true"></i> ARCHIVE LINK ONLINE</span></div><div class="container footer-grid"><div><strong>TAMA<span>MEDICS</span></strong><p>Repair it. Document it. Preserve it. Share it.</p></div><nav aria-label="Footer navigation"><a href="/clinic/">Clinic</a><a href="/research/">Research</a><a href="/projects/">Projects</a><a href="/devices/">Devices</a><a href="/contributing/">Contribute</a></nav><div><p>Open research and community documentation for virtual pet preservation.</p><a href="https://github.com/simplycole/tamamedics.com" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Project on GitHub ↗</a></div></div><div class="container fine-print">© {year} TamaMedics community. TamaMedics is an independent fan preservation and research project and is not affiliated with or endorsed by Bandai.</div></footer>
<style>footer{padding-block:var(--space-6) var(--space-5);border-top:1px solid var(--tm-border);background:#08050c}.system-line{display:flex;justify-content:space-between;gap:1rem;padding-bottom:var(--space-4);color:var(--tm-lcd);font:600 .61rem var(--font-mono);letter-spacing:.08em}.system-line i{display:inline-block;width:6px;height:6px;border-radius:50%;background:var(--tm-lcd)}.footer-grid{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1.2fr .8fr 1.2fr;gap:var(--space-6);padding-top:var(--space-6);border-top:1px solid var(--tm-border-soft)}strong{font:900 1.15rem var(--font-mono);color:var(--tm-text)}strong span{color:var(--tm-pink-bright)}p{margin:.4rem 0}nav{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr;gap:.35rem 1rem}nav a{font:650 .7rem var(--font-mono);text-transform:uppercase;text-decoration:none}.fine-print{margin-top:var(--space-6);padding-top:var(--space-4);border-top:1px solid rgba(255,255,255,.08);color:var(--tm-text-muted);font-size:.78rem}@media(max-width:760px){.footer-grid{grid-template-columns:1fr}.system-line{align-items:start;flex-direction:column}}</style>
